<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="PHP" style="id">- Teke-Tyee</book>
  <para style="h">FILIPE</para>
  <para style="toc3">Fil</para>
  <para style="toc2">Filipe</para>
  <para style="toc1">Mukaana a Poole kundaa basi Filipe</para>
  <para style="mt2">Mukaana a Poole kundaa basi</para>
  <para style="mt1">Filipe</para>
  <para style="imt">OSOMO</para>
  <para style="ip">Mukaana wu, Poole ásono nde kundaa libwunu li Nzaami lili mu Filipe, libwunu lili nsomo li ábala nde ku Erope. Nde ásono bo mukaana wu mu matala ma áli nde mu boloko ku Rome. Munsa mukaana wu, nde li mu osuo mana mandagha ma ákamono nde mu matala mamo, ya nde li mu obvurulu matuono kundaa libwunu li Nzaami mu libaha li bágwi bo nde. Nde ákatsimi mu bumõ ya bunsiili bu libwunu li Nzaami ŋa nkulu a bigyighili bi baara ba ba bákaluo maluo mama mpya. Nzaami aakagwa laama li linyaghara mu Kriste kundaa babo ba baakasa kana. Laama lilo liluru bilogho byehene ya liikayabiri edzuunu ya esee gwene otala mandagha mama bumweẽ bu ba baakasa kana. Me mu obo Poole ákughu osono mukaana mu boloko mu áli nde ya ályele ndagha yi: Liikakala a esee mu Mfumu bu lili emõ mu nde (<char style="xt"><ref loc="PHP 4:4">4.4</ref></char>).</para>
  <para style="ib" />
  <para style="iot">Mukaana wu baakakaba nde bu:</para>
  <para style="io1">- Ebaana ki mukaana (<char style="xt"><ref loc="PHP 1:1-11">1.1-11</ref></char>).</para>
  <para style="io1">- Mandagha ma óbwana a Poole mu bumweẽ bu nde (<char style="xt"><ref loc="PHP 1:12-26">1.12-26</ref></char>).</para>
  <para style="io1">- Kriste li efaana kundaa ba baakasa kana (<char style="xt"><ref loc="PHP 1:27-2:18">1.27–2.18</ref></char>).</para>
  <para style="io1">- Mi mitala Timote ya Epaforodite (<char style="xt"><ref loc="PHP 2:19-30">2.19-30</ref></char>).</para>
  <para style="io1">- Kriste li myehene lo ka mikyene o (<char style="xt"><ref loc="PHP 3:1-4:9">3.1–4.9</ref></char>).</para>
  <para style="io1">- Matuono mu libaha li ógwi libwunu (<char style="xt"><ref loc="PHP 4:10-23">4.10-23</ref></char>).</para>
  <para style="ie" />
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="PHP 1" />
  <para style="s1">Mboro</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PHP 1:1" />Me Poole ya Timote, bankana ba Yiisu-Kriste, lisono mukaana wu kundaa ba bangili bwohono mu Yiisu-Kriste ba bali mu bvulu lili Filipe, bakwuru ba libwunu li Nzaami ya basala: <verse eid="PHP 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="PHP 1:2" />Nyaã bwehe ya edzuunu bi bifi kundaa Nzaami Taara a bihi ya kundaa Mfumu a bihi Yiisu-Kriste bikala ya be!<verse eid="PHP 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Poole bvurulu matuono kundaa Nzaami</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PHP 1:3" />Matala mwohono ma aakansimi me be, me aakambvurulu matuono kundaa Nzaami. <verse eid="PHP 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="PHP 1:4" />Matala mwohono ma aakansamana me Nzaami mu be bwohono, me aakansamana mu esee, <verse eid="PHP 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="PHP 1:5" />mu kuulu be lili mu okabaha me mu otsala Nsia yi Mbwe, obaana mu etsughu kii nsomo tee sonali. <verse eid="PHP 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="PHP 1:6" />Me ndi a kana ti Munde wu áabaana esala ki ebwe mu be, sa amana kye tee mu etsughu ki oogyabvughuru Yiisu-Kriste. <verse eid="PHP 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="PHP 1:7" />Oli bubwe ti me kabulunkala a bitsimi bibi obo mu be bwohono. Mu engaŋma, me ndzyi be mu mukolo mumõ, mu kuulu be líibaha me mu esala ki ógwi me Nzaami mu bwehe bu nde. Be ka líbaha me yini a mu matala ma ándi me bumpoholo mu okala ya mu otsala Nsia yi Mbwe o, lo ya mu matala maha si ma ndi me munsa boloko. <verse eid="PHP 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="PHP 1:8" />Nzaami li mpughulu a me ti me ndzyi be bwohono mu nkwere a dzyi li Yiisu-Kriste.<verse eid="PHP 1:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PHP 1:9" />Ligyughu bu aakansamana me mu be: Nyaã dzyi li be lifiripfini ku olagha mu ligyahaba lili ngaŋma, ya mu obaghala kuu mukughu, <verse eid="PHP 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="PHP 1:10" />mu kuulu be lisoolo osuolo mimi mupfunu. Obo be sa likala baba tse-tse ya ba bagwene a epfwumu mu etsughu ki oogyabvughuru Kriste, <verse eid="PHP 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="PHP 1:11" />ya ba bálwulu mu bimburu bibi bunsumu bi liikagyagha bihi-a-be mu Yiisu-Kriste, mu ogwa nsia ya masyighi kundaa Nzaami.<verse eid="PHP 1:11" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Poole munsa boloko, Nsia yi Mbwe yitsaŋama</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PHP 1:12" />Bandughu ba me mu kana, me ndzyi be lisoolo ti mandagha ma máabwi mu me máasi kuulu ti Nsia yi Mbwe yigye ku nkulu. <verse eid="PHP 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="PHP 1:13" />Me mu obo, bambubulu bwohono ba baakakebe mu nzo a mukogho ya mu bibini bibike byehene, baagyighili osoolo ti mu nkooro a Kriste me ndi mu boloko. <verse eid="PHP 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="PHP 1:14" />Ya balagha mu bandughu mu kana, bu bamono me mu boloko, bali mu ofirikabagha bukyini mu Mfumu mu oluo Ndagha a Nzaami ku ogwene a nzalamweẽ.<verse eid="PHP 1:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PHP 1:15" />Oli ngaŋma ti baara babake bali mu okatsala Nsia yi Mbwe mu nkooro a embagha ya kunsa mumbaŋana. Lo babamõ bali mu okatsala nsia a Kriste mu bitsimi bi bibwe. <verse eid="PHP 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="PHP 1:16" />Baara ba baakasala mu dzyi, ya bo basoolo ti mu nkooro a okala Nsia yi Mbwe me ndi ŋa. <verse eid="PHP 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="PHP 1:17" />Lo baara babake babo, bo bali mu okatsala nsia a Kriste munsa mufulu wu embagha, bitsimi bi bo ka bili bi bitsyeme o. Bo baakatsimi ti oyo mpara a boloko li me bo bali mu okabwehe.<verse eid="PHP 1:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PHP 1:18" />Lo ndagha we! Ngu okala ti mu bitsimi bibi mpya bwunu we bibi ngaŋma, lo nsia a Kriste yili mu okatsaŋama. Ya mu obo me ndi a esee, ya me sa firikankala mu esee. <verse eid="PHP 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="PHP 1:19" />Mu kuulu me nsoolo ti mandagha mwohono mamo sa masa ti me mvwughu, mu nkooro a nsamana a be ya libaha li Mufulu a Yiisu-Kriste. <verse eid="PHP 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="PHP 1:20" />Bwunu a bu oli ma ndi mu okabulunkebe me ya ma aansi me emiini ku olagha, me ka ankala a bupfiri mu ndagha si mõ o. Lo mu emiini kyehene, lolo bu ya mu matala mwohono, Kriste sa akala a nsia mu nyuru a me, mu bumweẽ bu me bwunu we mu lipfu li me. <verse eid="PHP 1:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="PHP 1:21" />Mu kuulu mu me, bumweẽ ngu Kriste, ya lipfu lili ndaana a me. <verse eid="PHP 1:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="PHP 1:22" />Lo kala ti okala mweẽ oli ndaana mu me mu osala esala, me ka nsoolo emakye me nfaana osuolo o. <verse eid="PHP 1:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="PHP 1:23" />Me ndi mu ogwimi ŋa kara oŋo: Me ndi a nzala a ogye ya okala ya Kriste, obo obvulu bubwe. <verse eid="PHP 1:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="PHP 1:24" />Lo mu nkooro a be, obvulu mupfunu me nkala wu a mweẽ. <verse eid="PHP 1:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="PHP 1:25" />Mu obo me ndi a kana ya me nsoolo ti me sa ndaama, ya sa nkala ya be mpaala be ligye ku nkulu mu esee e kana li be. <verse eid="PHP 1:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="PHP 1:26" />Mpaala mu nkooro a me, mu matala ma aayambvughuru me ŋa kara li be, mutwunu wu lili a be mu Yiisu-Kriste akulu.<verse eid="PHP 1:26" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mvulu mu otsala Nsia yi Mbwe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="PHP 1:27" />Be ngu baala liikadzyara mu efaana kii Nsia yi Mbwe yi a Kriste. Mu kuulu, ngu okala ti me yamono be, ngu okala ti me ka ngyi o, me ngyughu ti be liitemene mu mufulu mumõ, bu liikadzwana mvulu emõ, mu mukolo mumõ mu nkooro a kana li ookagwa Nsia yi Mbwe. <verse eid="PHP 1:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="PHP 1:28" />Be ka likala a nzalamweẽ a mitaara mi be o. Kundaa bo, ekye me elyimi kii opfighili o bo. Lo kundaa be, ekye elyimi ki eesuo ti be liibvwughu, ya kye efi kundaa Nzaami. <verse eid="PHP 1:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="PHP 1:29" />Mu kuulu, Nzaami aagwi be bwehe mu osala mu Kriste. Ka oli yini a mu osa kana mu nde o, lo mu omono mpara mu nkooro a nde si, <verse eid="PHP 1:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="PHP 1:30" />mu okabuludzwana mvulu yi límono be me mu okadzwana, mvulu yi lisoolo be ti tee sonali, me ndi mu okadzwana yo.<verse eid="PHP 1:30" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PHP 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="PHP 2" />
  <para style="s1">Okughulu ya bunene bu Kriste</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PHP 2:1" />Kala ti oli a mpama mu Kriste, kala ti oli a bukyini mu dzyi, kala ti oli a bumõ bu Mufulu, kala ti oli a nkwere a dzyi ya nyiĩ mu babamõ, <verse eid="PHP 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="PHP 2:2" />lo lisa kuulu ti munyuŋu a me akala mukughu be bu likala kunsa ogwihini. Liikakala a dzyi limõ, mukolo mumõ ya etsimi emõ. <verse eid="PHP 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="PHP 2:3" />Ka likasa mandagha mu embagha o, bwunu we mu osagha nsia yi a bwunu. Lo kunsa okughulu, liikatala babake ti anga bo babvulu be. <verse eid="PHP 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="PHP 2:4" />Nswe mbwuru mu be anyaã okasagha yini a ndaana yi a ndaa ndeme, lo akasagha si ndaana yi a banganda. <verse eid="PHP 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="PHP 2:5" />Ŋa kara li be, liikadzyara bu ofaana mu Kriste Yiisu:<verse eid="PHP 2:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PHP 2:6" />Ngu okala ti ka óli a lisobo ŋa kara li nde ya Nzaami o,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PHP 2:6">lo nde ka ásagha kee-kee akebe bunsihi bu nde ya Nzaami o.<verse eid="PHP 2:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PHP 2:7" />Lo mu ndeme, nde ábihi byehene bibye,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PHP 2:7">mu okala musala, nde áfaana ya baara,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PHP 2:7">ya omoŋono ti nde li nkara a mbwuru.<verse eid="PHP 2:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PHP 2:8" />Nde ákughulu ndeme mu okala a bintamana tee ku lipfu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PHP 2:8">lipfu lili ŋa yulu a kuruwa.<verse eid="PHP 2:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PHP 2:9" />Me mu obo, Nzaami mu waa li ndeme ákuhubu nde,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PHP 2:9">ya ágwi nde Nkwumu yibvulu mankwumu mwohono.<verse eid="PHP 2:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PHP 2:10" />Mu kuulu, mu nkwumu a Yiisu mabuo mwohono, bakunu mo mu mayulu, ŋa nsie, ya ku nsini a nsie,<verse eid="PHP 2:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PHP 2:11" />ya nswe mbwuru abili ti Yiisu-Kriste li Mfumu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PHP 2:11">mu ogwa nsia kundaa Nzaami Taara.<verse eid="PHP 2:11" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Osehene ti anga mambaa mu nsie nsyini</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PHP 2:12" />Mu obo, bandughu ba me baba mukolo, be ba lili a bintamana mu me mu matala mwohono, ka likasuo bye yini a ŋa nkulu a me o, lo liikabvulu osa obo mu matala maala me ka ndi ya be o. Liikasala mu budziri ya enkwughu mu obvwughu o be, <verse eid="PHP 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="PHP 2:13" />me Nzaami aakasala mu be ya aakagwa be waa ya osa mandagha ma aakadzyi nde.<verse eid="PHP 2:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PHP 2:14" />Liikagyighili mandagha mwohono gwene a miŋuŋunu ya mikeme, <verse eid="PHP 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="PHP 2:15" />mpaala banyaã obagha mi baasyeme be ya be likala baba tse-tse, baana ba Nzaami ba bagwene a epfwumu ŋa kara li eseene ki égwuŋumu ya ki ebi ki. Ŋa kara li eseene ekye, be lili ti anga ba baakagwa otsyeme ŋa yulu a nsie, <verse eid="PHP 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="PHP 2:16" />bu liikabiri nsia a Ndagha yi a laama. Obo, me sa nkala a mutwunu mu etsughu ki ooyabvughuru Kriste, mu kuulu me ka aambara ntyini yi a bwunu o ya ka aamono mpara yi a bwunu o.<verse eid="PHP 2:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PHP 2:17" />Lo ngu okala ti bafaana ogyiri makili ma me ŋa yulu a ekaba ki baagwa kundaa Nzaami, ekaba ki eli esala e kana li be, me sa nkala a munyuŋu ya sa nkala mu esee emõ ya be. <verse eid="PHP 2:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="PHP 2:18" />Bumõ si kundaa be, likala a munyuŋu mu obo, ya likala mu esee emõ ya me.<verse eid="PHP 2:18" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Timote ya Epaforodite</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PHP 2:19" />Me ndi a kana mu Mfumu Yiisu ti edzi-dzighi me sa ngweghe be Timote mpaala mehe si mbagha bukyini mu mampolo ma be ma akala aambagha me. <verse eid="PHP 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="PHP 2:20" />Me ka ndi a mbwuru mukimi ŋa yulu a nde o, wu li a bitsimi bimõ ya me, wu li a manguo<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2.20 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">manguo </char><char style="ft" closed="false">bana ti minyoŋo</char></note> mama ngaŋma mu mandagha ma matala be. <verse eid="PHP 2:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="PHP 2:21" />Bo bwohono baakabulusagha yini a ndaana a bomo, lo ka yi a ndaa Yiisu-Kriste o. <verse eid="PHP 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="PHP 2:22" />Lo nde, be lisoolo ti nde ámaasuo bilyimi: nde ásala ya me ti anga mwana ŋa likara li taara a nde, mu esala kii Nsia yi Mbwe. <verse eid="PHP 2:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="PHP 2:23" />Me nde me akala aangweghe kundaa be, mu matala ma akala aansoolo me bu baagyighili ndagha a me. <verse eid="PHP 2:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="PHP 2:24" />Me ndi a kana mu Mfumu ti edzi-dzighi, meme si sa ngya kundaa be.<verse eid="PHP 2:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="PHP 2:25" />Lo me aamono ti oli mupfunu mu obvurulu Epaforodite kundaa be, ndughu a me mu kana, ndughu a me wu esala ya wu mamvulu, munde wu áli ligweghe be mu oyagwa me libaha li ándi a me nzala a lo. <verse eid="PHP 2:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="PHP 2:26" />Nde dzyi omono be bwohono ku olagha, ya nde li mu okamono mpara mu nkooro nsia yi a obyele o nde yi liigyughu be. <verse eid="PHP 2:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="PHP 2:27" />Nde aali mubyele, bele ya lipfu, lo Nzaami aamono nde nyiĩ. Ka oli yini a nde o, lo ya mehe si, mpaala me nyaã okala a minyoõ ŋa yulu a minyoõ. <verse eid="PHP 2:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="PHP 2:28" />Me mu obo me nsi maswa mu obvurulu be nde mpaala ŋa akala liimono be nde be lifirikala a esee ya minyoõ mi me mikala misala. <verse eid="PHP 2:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="PHP 2:29" />Libwana a nde mu esee kyehene mu Mfumu, ya liikagwa budziri kundaa baara baba ti nde, <verse eid="PHP 2:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="PHP 2:30" />buulu mu nkooro a esala e Yiisu nde ákaakpa ya ákaapfihili laama li nde, mu osa esala ki obaha me ŋa ebini e be.<verse eid="PHP 2:30" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PHP 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="PHP 3" />
  <para style="s1">Bunsumu bubu ngaŋma ŋa mihi mi Nzaami</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PHP 3:1" />Mu matala ma, bandughu ba me mu kana, liikakala mu esee mu Mfumu. Kundaa me ka yili ndagha yi a mpara o, mu ofirisono be mandagha ma ánswama osono me be. Obo obvulu bubwe kundaa be. <verse eid="PHP 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="PHP 3:2" />Liikasa mayele mu bambwa, liikasa mayele mu basala ba babi, liikasa mayele mu ba básomo nzo a mbaa yi a mpya. <verse eid="PHP 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="PHP 3:3" />Mu kuulu ba básomo nzo a mbaa yi a ngaŋma me bihi, ba liikasamana Nzaami mu Mufulu, ba liikasuo mutwunu a bihi mu Yiisu-Kriste, bihi ka liikasa kana mu bihi bameme o. <verse eid="PHP 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="PHP 3:4" />Mu ogyighili otala me ndi a bwuu mu okasa kana mu meme. Kala ti mbwuru mukimi aakatsimi osa kana mu ndeme, lo asoolo ti me mvulu nde ku olagha. <verse eid="PHP 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="PHP 3:5" />Me, básohobo me nzo a mbaa mu etsughu kii mpuomo, me ndi mu etswumu kii Isarayele, mu dzumu li Benzamẽ, mu-Eebere wu báburu kundaa ba-Eebere. Mu mi mitala osalala Mikyene, me ndi mu-Faridzyẽ. <verse eid="PHP 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="PHP 3:6" />Me aandi a mbaa mu bipfu bi ba-Dzwife, me áakamwehẽ libwunu li Nzaami kimini, mu mi mitala bunsumu bu Mikyene, me ka ándi a mi bakughu osyeme me o. <verse eid="PHP 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="PHP 3:7" />Ankoho bilogho byehene bi ákamono me ti bíli ndaana kundaa me, me ndi mu omono bye ti bilogho bibi bwunu mu nkooro a Kriste. <verse eid="PHP 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="PHP 3:8" />Lo me aamono si ti bye byehene bili bilogho bibi bwunu, ŋa nkulu a busini bu bubvulu bunene: Busini bubo ngu osoolo Kriste Yiisu, Mfumu a me. Mu nkooro a nde, me áampfihili byehene bi ándi a bye, ya me ndi mu otala bye ti anga yala, mpaala me mbagha Kriste, <verse eid="PHP 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="PHP 3:9" />ya me nkala emõ ya nde. Ka oli mu bunsumu bubu meme o, bu bufi mu mikyene, lo bufi mu kana mu Kriste, bunsumu bu bufi kundaa Nzaami ya bu busiŋi mu kana. <verse eid="PHP 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="PHP 3:10" />Bu ndzyi me mu matala ma, me osoolo Kriste, nde, ya lileene li osighili o nde mu lipfu, ya okala bumõ mu mpara a nde, mu ofaana ti nde mu lipfu li nde, <verse eid="PHP 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="PHP 3:11" />mpaala me ndeene osighili ŋa kara li ba bákpi, kala okughu okala.<verse eid="PHP 3:11" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Obara ntyini mu olughulu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PHP 3:12" />Ka litsimi o ti me aandughulu mu byehene bibye bwunu we ti me ayi ndi mukughu, lo me ndi mu okabara ntyini mpaala me ndughulu byehene bibye, mu kuulu Yiisu-Kriste ndeme áyi akwara me. <verse eid="PHP 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="PHP 3:13" />Bandughu ba me mu kana, me meme ka nkughu otsimi ti me ayi aandughulu o. Lo ndagha mõ me ndi mu okasa: Okadzimini mandagha mwohono ma máluru, ya me ndi mu okasa mukama mpaala me ndughulu mu mandagha ma mali ku nkulu. <verse eid="PHP 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="PHP 3:14" />Mu obo, me ndi mu obara ntyini, tee ku aandughulu me mu mbili yi a ku yulu yi óti bihi Nzaami mu Yiisu-Kriste.<verse eid="PHP 3:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PHP 3:15" />Bihi bwohono ba lili baara baba mukughu mu enzaami, liikatsimi obo. Lo kala ti be lili mu eteese kii okatsimi bukimi, Nzaami sa asuo be yo. <verse eid="PHP 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="PHP 3:16" />Lo si okala ti ka bunu, ŋa ebini ki liiyato ki, litswe likadzyara mu nzili nga-mõ ti bu liisi mu oyato mu matala ma.<verse eid="PHP 3:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PHP 3:17" />Bandughu ba me mu kana, be bwohono liikanama mi aangyighili me, liikagyighili otala ba baakadzyara mu efaana ki lili mu omono be mu bihi. <verse eid="PHP 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="PHP 3:18" />Ti bwunu a bu ákandyele me be mu matala nswe matala, ya mu matala maha si me ndi mu okalyele be kunsa elili ti, balagha bali mu okadzyara ti mitaara mi kuruwa li Kriste. <verse eid="PHP 3:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="PHP 3:19" />Masini ma bo me opfighili, nzaami a bo me mila mi bo, ya bali mu omono esee mu mi mifaana ogwa bo bupfuru. Bo baala bitsimi yini a mu bibi nsie. <verse eid="PHP 3:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="PHP 3:20" />Lo bihi, bihi lili baara baba Emfumu ki mayulu, ku oofa Mfumu Yiisu-Kriste, Mubvwuhu wu lili mu okakebe bihi. <verse eid="PHP 3:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="PHP 3:21" />Nde wu akala aakirili nyuru a bihi yi minyoõ yikala ti bu oli nyuru a nde yi a nsia, mu lileene li lili mu ogwa nde muswa wu otwulu bilogho byehene kunsa litumu li nde.<verse eid="PHP 3:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PHP 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="PHP 4" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PHP 4:1" />Mu obo, bandughu ba me mu kana baba mukolo, me ndi a nzala a ofirimono be, be ba liikagwa me munyuũ ya be ba lili kagha li me lili nsia! Bangee ba me baba mukolo, obo me bu lifaana be okala a mukama mu Mfumu.<verse eid="PHP 4:1" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Litumu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PHP 4:2" />Evodi ya Sẽtisye, yoboo me mbuono be mu okala ya ogwihini be a be mu Mfumu. <verse eid="PHP 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="PHP 4:3" />Ya we mbaala a me wu esala wu a ngaŋma, me nduomo we mu obaha bo. Mu kuulu bo bádzwana emõ ya me mu nkooro a Nsia yi Mbwe, emõ si ya Kelemõ ya bandughu ba me baba esala babake. Mankwumu ma bo mali mu mukaana wu a bumweẽ.<verse eid="PHP 4:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PHP 4:4" />Liikakala a esee mu Mfumu matala mwohono, me firindyele yo, liikakala a esee!<verse eid="PHP 4:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PHP 4:5" />Nyaã bubwe bu be bumoŋono ŋa mihi mi baara bwohono! Mfumu ayi aabehene. <verse eid="PHP 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="PHP 4:6" />Ka likakala a minyoõ mu ndagha si mõ o. Lo mu matala mwohono, liikalyele kundaa Nzaami bi lili a be nzala a bye, mu lisamana, mu obuono ya mu obvurulu matuono. <verse eid="PHP 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="PHP 4:7" />Ya edzuunu e Nzaami ki eluru mayele mwohono sa ekebe mikolo mi be ya bitsimi bi be mu Yiisu-Kriste.<verse eid="PHP 4:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PHP 4:8" />Baana ba Taara a me, mu omana, be lifaana okatsimi mu mandagha mwohono mama ngaŋma, mama budziri, mama bunsumu, mama tse-tse, ma bafaana okadzyi, ma bafaana okagwa nsia, ma mabwe ya ma bafaana okasyighi. <verse eid="PHP 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="PHP 4:9" />Liikasalala mandagha mwohono ma lígyighi be kundaa me, ma lígyagha be, ma lígyughu be me mu okalyele ya ma límono be me mu okasa. Ya Nzaami wu a edzuunu sa akala ya be.<verse eid="PHP 4:9" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Poole bvurulu matuono mu nkooro a bikaba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PHP 4:10" />Me aamono esee ki elagha mu Mfumu mu kuulu ku masini, bitsimi bi be mu me biifulu. Mu engaŋma, be líili a bitsimi, lo ka líkabagha mpeene mu osuo me bye o. <verse eid="PHP 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="PHP 4:11" />Ka oli nzala a obagha yitumu me mu obili obo o, mu kuulu me aangyighi okakala a esee matala mwohono mu bilogho bi ndi a bye. <verse eid="PHP 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="PHP 4:12" />Me nsoolo okala kunsa buwele, ya me nsoolo okala kunsa bupfulu. Mu matala mwohono ya mu mandagha mwohono, me aangyighi mu okala a yughuru bwunu we mu okala a nzala, ngu okala ti me ndi kunsa bupfulu bwunu we kunsa makeghele. <verse eid="PHP 4:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="PHP 4:13" />Me nkughu osa mandagha mwohono mu libaha li munde wu aakagwa me lileene. <verse eid="PHP 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="PHP 4:14" />Lo be liisi bubwe bu liibaha me mu mpara a me.<verse eid="PHP 4:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PHP 4:15" />Be basi Filipe, be lisoolo ti ku ebaana e Nsia yi Mbwe, mu matala ma ámpfi me mu etsulu e nsie kii Masedwane, ka óli a libwunu li Nzaami likimi li lígwi me libaha o, kala ka yini a lili ndaa be o. <verse eid="PHP 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="PHP 4:16" />Mu matala ma ándi me ku Tesalonike, be áli liigweghe me bi ákankala a me nzala a bye mansa mwolo. <verse eid="PHP 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="PHP 4:17" />Ka oli ti me bimbwaŋa ndi mu okasagha o. Lo me ndi mu okasagha ti ndaana yibvulu yikala yi a ndaa be. <verse eid="PHP 4:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="PHP 4:18" />Me áangyagha bilogho byehene ya me ndi kunsa bupfulu bu bulagha. Me áambagha bilogho byehene bi ákankala a me nzala a bye ŋa áangyagha me bi líigweghe be me kundaa Epaforodite. Bye bili mananaase mama mpihi yi mbwe, mukaba wu ookihi Nzaami ya wu aagwi nde esee. <verse eid="PHP 4:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="PHP 4:19" />Ya Nzaami a me sa aluhu be mu bilogho byehene bi liikala a be nzala a bye, bwunu a bu oli nsia a busini bu nde mu Yiisu-Kriste. <verse eid="PHP 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="PHP 4:20" />Nyaã nsia yikala kundaa Nzaami Taara a bihi mu mibvu ya mibvu. Aamene!<verse eid="PHP 4:20" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mamboro mama masini</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PHP 4:21" />Ligwa mboro kundaa nswe wu a ngili mu Yiisu-Kriste. Bandughu mu kana ba bali ya me bagwi be mboro. <verse eid="PHP 4:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="PHP 4:22" />Ba bangili bwohono bagweghe be mboro, emvulu-ngughu babo ba bali mu nzo a Sedzare.<verse eid="PHP 4:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PHP 4:23" />Nyaã bwehe bu Mfumu Yiisu-Kriste bukala ya be bwohono!<verse eid="PHP 4:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PHP 4" />
</usx>